  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_languet_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>languet, a tongue-shaped ornament, esp. a drop of amber, jet etc. (OED languet n. 2), here for the decoration of an altar-cloth</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
